              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "угощение (ugoshchéniye) — \"treats, refreshments\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Угощение было очень вкусным. Ugoshchéniye býlo óchen vkúsnym. The treats were very tasty."
            },
