          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "угощение (ugoshchéniye) is built on угощать (ugoshchát) \"to treat\", from гость \"a guest\", inherited from Proto-Slavic gostĭ, PIE gʰóstis (EtymDB)."
